@startuml get-manager-access-log
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/access-log
caption CRB-81 · 어드민의 개인정보 열람 · 개발용 회원 완전탈퇴 기록 목록 (superadmin 전용, 읽기 전용). 기록은 기존대로 명함 조회 · 회원 삭제 서비스가 남김

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard\n+ SuperAdminGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "AdminAccessLogController" as Controller
participant "AdminAccessLogService" as Service
participant "AdminAccessLogRepository" as AccessRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/access-log?admin_email&target_type&created_from&created_to&page&size\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard + SuperAdminGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found\n403 Superadmin privilege is required.
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt query 검증 실패 (target_type은 business_card · dev_user_hard_delete, 날짜 형식, page · size 범위)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: list(query)
Controller -> Service: list(query)
alt created_from이 created_to보다 늦음
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 400 created_from must not be after created_to
end
Service -> AccessRepository: findPage(filter, offset, limit)
par 동시에 조회 — 같은 조건
  AccessRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT admin_access_log\nWHERE admin_email ILIKE ? AND target_type = ? AND created_at 범위\nORDER BY created_at DESC, pk DESC LIMIT OFFSET
  PostgreSQL --> AccessRepository: rows
else
  AccessRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT count(*) (같은 조건)
  PostgreSQL --> AccessRepository: total
end
AccessRepository --> Service: { rows, total }
note right of Service
  target_id: business_card는 graduated.pk, dev_user_hard_delete는 지운 users.pk.
  이 조회 자체는 기록하지 않음
end note
Service --> Controller: PageResponseDto<AdminAccessLogDto>
Controller --> Client: 200 { items: [{ pk, admin_email, target_type, target_id, created_at }], page, size, total }

@enduml
